===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|indéclinable|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|frm|en}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|indeclinabilis|lang=la}}. See {{term|in-}} not, and {{term|decline}}.

